      "text": "[Course image]\nAvailable     #extensions #pro\nHair Extensions Basic + Pro\nThe full extension path for stylists who want the foundation and the advanced method.\nStart Learning     Back to Courses\n\nWhat this course teaches\nClient consultation, preparation, installation rhythm, blending, aftercare, and service confidence.\n\nWho it is for\nStylists who want more than a preview and need the complete path.\n\nCourse contents\n01 Basic foundation\n02 Placement method\n03 Blend and finish\n04 Client workflow\n05 Pro service system",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 427,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[Course image]\nAvailable     #extensions #pro\nHair Extensions Basic + Pro\nThe full extension path for stylists who want the foundation and the advanced method.\nStart Learning     Back to Courses\n\nWhat this course teaches\nClient consultation, preparation, installation rhythm, blending, aftercare, and service confidence.\n\nWho it is for\nStylists who want more than a preview and need the complete path.\n\nCourse contents\n01 Basic foundation\n02 Placement method\n03 Blend and finish\n04 Client workflow\n05 Pro service system",
